      "writtenOn": "2022-05-10T20:42:52Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Indeed. But we do width * 4 below anyway so that should be checked once and for all. I\u0027ll do a follow-up patch.\nThe WebPPicture should have dimensions/specs that fit in the WebP format (16K width at most and such)",
