      "writtenOn": "2022-05-11T00:10:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "\u003e Indeed. But we do width * 4 below anyway so that should be checked once and for all. I\u0027ll do a follow-up patch.\n\u003e The WebPPicture should have dimensions/specs that fit in the WebP format (16K width at most and such)\n\nremember we might scale the input though. In these types of tests it\u0027s best to test what you can control, so stride / 4 is safer after checking sign on width/height, etc.",
      "parentUuid": "75f9ff94_5f600613",
